      "side": 1,
      "message": "// DSAPublicKey represents a DSA public key for serialisation.\n\n(It\u0027s a shame that these become exposed API, but since you need them in agent/ perhaps that\u0027s needed.)",
      "revId": "3073400165a794e8b234e60caaf027d08cbe627c",
